    "Medium hears Romanian more accurately but is a larger download. Switching models downloads the chosen one if you don't already have it — manual entry works throughout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Medium hears Romanian more accurately but is a larger download. Switching models downloads the chosen one if you don't already have it — manual entry works throughout."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mediu aude româna mai exact, dar are o descărcare mai mare. Schimbarea modelului îl descarcă pe cel ales dacă nu îl ai deja — introducerea manuală funcționează oricând."
          }
        }
